     "titulo": "Forms and administrative details",
     "texto": [
      "In Dutch forms and administrative documents, information usually appears under short field labels: «voornaam» (first name), «achternaam» (surname or family name), «geboortedatum» (date of birth), «adres» (address with street and number) and «postcode» (Dutch postal code, made of four digits and two uppercase letters, for example «3511 AB»)."
